<h2 id="neatlog-plan" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">5. Plan authoring (onlyref / qimpl)</h2>

Every runner/harness phase **Exit** must include:

- **neat_logger** component name + **`logs/ops/…`** file
- **JSONL** path + progress **`step`** vocabulary
- **DEBUG** env var + what extra fields appear
- **Resume** behavior if N × lanes &gt; 50

---

<h2 id="neatlog-impl" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">6. Implement (aciub / implref)</h2>

- Logging in the **same phase** as the runner.
- Smoke with **`tail -f`** noted in plan or chat.
- On phase **`[X]`**, spot-check: start line, per-row progress, at least one DEBUG path when env set.

---

<h2 id="neatlog-anti" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">7. Anti-patterns</h2>

| Anti-pattern | Why |
|--------------|-----|
| Silent loop | Cannot deduce failing ticket |
| End-only JSON | Crash loses all rows |
| Raw stdlib logging without neat_logger on CLIs | Loses unified tags/colors/ops paths |
| DEBUG always on in CI default | Noise — gate with env |

---

<h2 id="neatlog-self" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">8. Self-check (agent)</h2>

- [ ] CLI/harness uses **neat_logger** (not print-only).
- [ ] JSONL checkpoint if run can fail mid-way.
- [ ] DEBUG hooks on non-obvious branches (env-gated).
- [ ] **onlyref/qimpl/implref** plan bar updated when adding runners.
